mPsby2Icvo82w286jlRroPoyq-p9eNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC3vph-9b2Bsph78xC4AJHK3ql2XqwA9Ov3tgu0oICq9A&oe=6A5F78B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s3Ki30UqsfMQ7kNvwEbkuW_&_nc_oc=Adp3IZu__D0tBr_nE28tYOLcyVoMDH_VotdOVklaLO__ZdaFEaPmqyKFm9gW7_QMF88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCvm5T2rhhvizFnQZAs_Tayym1ydKM32GLbs7cxLwFHLQ&oe=6A5F65D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G8CgwmFyyQIQ7kNvwEc0_6N&_nc_oc=AdqxreETqRzBzum4tbwxTJtuKP2eAxrTRNg4LBBpx75suK8eZPU6e3_X31lvSyumJ04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDvdvOZXntscKDqq5Y4KY5kXaJFoFnJoGEbmvlLFuzFrA&oe=6A5F6B15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=im7Qlym5KjwQ7kNvwGJ7UgE&_nc_oc=AdrktvFdT3V-441t5rRV3Ci2EdaE8A6QzFv4iL2lfaspff0_q-9PHxI8zNkqXsK7gr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDlVvmn2kjQCFx6SLvUqJ7Gge4KLCXUC6UcEyNA73jMeQ&oe=6A5F7EC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j5fTCj2A8ssQ7kNvwGFeXxD&_nc_oc=AdpHisgVFwX5MdG7qqIkD4qNBefnyRzNwNacEO98ot0qi-W7yOSw0fcfC1aQ7hXITzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDffMe1txtvzBKjCN6yotLcIsM1I-Koetcer2Ab_wdlMQ&oe=6A5F6544"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iiIcAdtCYnEQ7kNvwHRqVGk&_nc_oc=AdrgY5W7khZ7j8YN6qEXwwfXgf1Gm7BhQfkFyk0lXkPHQXsaTMBmdARdHIX4FDe